# The secrets src/env.ts declares, one line each; a test checks none is
# missing. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for each value here: give
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET a new one, from `openssl rand -base64 32`, never this
# placeholder. `bun run dev` writes .dev.vars with a new BETTER_AUTH_SECRET the
# first time it runs, so there's nothing to copy; it replaces this placeholder
# if .dev.vars holds it.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-me-with-the-output-of-openssl-rand-base64-32
